## Field Definitions
- **Criticality** — Business/lab impact if the asset is unavailable or compromised (High / Medium / Low).
- **Environment** — Where the asset sits: IT (on-prem lab), Lab (general lab endpoint), or Cloud.
- **Status** — Active, Decommissioned, or Planned.
- **Last Reviewed** — Date this row was last verified as accurate; update whenever the asset changes.

## Maintenance
Update this file whenever an asset is added, removed, or changes criticality/status. The Risk Register should be reviewed after any change here, since new or changed assets may introduce new risks.
